<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-1589-2020-ar-learning-experience-model> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An IEEE standard for interoperable augmented-reality learning systems. It defines a conceptual model for relationships among the physical world, the learner, digital information, learning activities, and the environment, along with data models and XML/JSON bindings for representing activities and context." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-1589-2020-ar-learning-experience-model/versions/1> .
