<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-1589-2020-ar-learning-experience-model> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "A common AR learning model supports reusable content, interchangeable components, experience repositories, and learning experiences that can move across otherwise proprietary AR platforms." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-1589-2020-ar-learning-experience-model/versions/1> .
